<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes :             1. The Statement include the results of H.G. Infra Engineering Ltd. (including 3 jointly controlled operation)    (  the Holding Company ) and 9 subsidiaries. This statement has been prepared in accordance with the Companies (Ind AS) Rules, 2015 (Ind AS) prescribed under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013 and other recognised accounting practices and policies to the extent applicable.   2. In terms of Regulation 33 and 52 of the SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015, the Consolidated financial results of the Group have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the BOD at their respective meeting held on May 23, 2022.           3. Summary of key standalone financial results is as follows:      Particulars For the quarter ended  For the year ended    March 31,   2022 December 31,   2021 March 31,   2021 March 31,   2022 March 31,   2021    Revenues from operations           10,259.30             9,224.49           10,307.74           36,151.95           25,349.70     Profit before tax             1,216.48             1,200.83             1,324.15             4,546.36             2,821.14     Profit after tax                911.10                888.89                976.59             3,387.60             2,109.60    Note: The above Standalone financial results of the Company are available on the Company's website (www.hginfra.com) and also on the website of BSE (www.bseindia.corn) and NSE (www.nseindia.com), where the equity shares of the Company are listed. The information above has been extracted from the published standalone financial results.           4. Figures for the quarters ended 31.03.2022 and 31.03.2021 are balancing figures between audited figure for the full financial year ended on 31.03.2022 and 31.03.2021 and the published year to date figures upto the third quarter of the respective financial years.           5. The Group is primarily engaged in the business of Engineering, Procurement and Construction (EPC) relating to roads, bridges, flyovers and infrastructure contract works and related activities. As such there is no separate reportable operating segment as defined by Ind AS 108  Operating Segments .   6. The consolidated financial results include the financial results of the Holding Company (including 3 joint controlled operations - HGIEPL – Ranjit JV, HGIEPL– MGCPL JV and HGIEPL – RPS JV) and its 9 subsidiaries - Gurgaon Sohna Highway Pvt. Ltd., HG Ateli Narnaul Highway Pvt. Ltd., HG Rewari Ateli Highway Pvt. Ltd., HG Rewari Bypass Pvt. Ltd., HG Raipur Visakhapatnam AP-1 Pvt. Ltd., H.G. Khammam Devarapalle PKG-1 Pvt. Ltd., H.G. Khammam Devarapalle PKG-2 Pvt. Ltd., H.G. Raipur Visakhapatnam OD-5 Pvt. Ltd. and H.G. Raipur Visakhapatnam OD-6 Pvt. Ltd.   7. During the year, five wholly owned subsidiaries i.e. H.G. Raipur Visakhapatnam AP-1 Pvt. Ltd., H.G. Khammam Devarapalle PKG-1 Pvt. Ltd., H.G. Khammam Devarapalle PKG-2 Pvt. Ltd., H.G. Raipur Visakhapatnam OD-5 Pvt. Ltd. and H.G. Raipur Visakhapatnam OD-6 Pvt. Ltd. have been incorporated by the holding Company.   8. During the nine months ended 31.12.2021 company has issued Rated, Listed, Senior, Secured, Redeemable, Non-Convertible Debentures aggregating to Rs. 970 Millions on Private Placement Basis. The NCDs is listed on the wholesale debt market (WDM) segment of BSE limited.           9. The above Consolidated financial results of the Group are available on the Company's website and also on the website of BSE and NSE where the equity shares of the Company are listed.         10. Previous year / period figures have been re-grouped / re-classified wherever necessary, to conform to current year's classification in order to comply with the requirements of the amended Schedule Ill to the Companies Act, 2013 effective 01.04.2021   11. other notes as mentioned in PDF file filed by the Company.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
